- Initial release of LocalVault!
- 100% offline local storage to keep your passwords and sensitive data private.
- Biometric authentication (Fingerprint / Face Unlock) for secure and fast access.
- Secure encrypted export and import (PIN-protected) for easy backups and device transfers.
- Flexible custom fields: accounts, concealed passwords/PINs, and notes.
- Dark/Light theme support and fast keyword search.
